---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Rex Autistikōn Labs" 
  description="Independent research into the biomechanics of sensory and interoceptive signaling in neurodevelopmental conditions."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 border-b border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">
        Rex Autistikōn Labs
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-slate-600 mb-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Independent research into the biomechanics of sensory and interoceptive signaling
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        We investigate how chronic mechanical restriction in sensor-rich myofascial and visceral interfaces may alter afferent information reaching the central nervous system in neurodevelopmental conditions.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/research" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-teal-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors">
          Explore the Research
        </a>
        <a href="/model" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
          Interactive Model
        </a>
        <a href="/publications" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
          Publications
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Collaborator Portal Call-to-Action -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-teal-50 border-b border-teal-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">
        Collaborator Data Intake Portal
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Approved research partners can securely submit 8-zone myofascial measurements for Phase 1 Kelvin-Voigt and free-energy analysis.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="https://intake.rexautistikonlabs.org/intake" 
        class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-3.5 bg-teal-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors shadow-sm"
      >
        Enter Data Intake Portal →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-6">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Rex Autistikōn Labs, operating under the Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc., is an independent 501(c)(3) research initiative dedicated to advancing a rigorous, multi-scale understanding of peripheral mechanical contributions to sensory, motor, and regulatory differences observed in autism spectrum disorder and related conditions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        We integrate biotensegrity theory, fascia as a sensory organ, mechanotransduction, viscoelastic signal filtering, and predictive coding to generate testable hypotheses and mechanism-based research directions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key areas -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Research Framework</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A biotensegrity-informed hypothesis centered on eight sensor-rich myofascial and visceral interfaces.
          </p>
          <a href="/research" class="text-teal-700 text-sm font-medium hover:text-teal-800">Read more →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Interactive Model</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Explore Normal vs Neurodivergent tension dynamics and their effects on signal fidelity in real time.
          </p>
          <a href="/model" class="text-teal-700 text-sm font-medium hover:text-teal-800">Launch model →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Open Science</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Primary theoretical work is published with open access. Collaborations and experimental validation are welcome.
          </p>
          <a href="/publications" class="text-teal-700 text-sm font-medium hover:text-teal-800">View publications →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Current status -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-6">Current Focus</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-teal-700">•</span>
          <span>Phase 1 Interactive Model deployed and documented</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-teal-700">•</span>
          <span>Open-access primary monograph and collaborator handbook available</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-teal-700">•</span>
          <span>Experimental pathways (shear-wave elastography, interoceptive markers) in planning</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/roadmap" class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800">
        View full research roadmap →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>